{"id":"torrey:calves-of-jeroboam","source":"torrey","name":"Calves Of Jeroboam","slug":"calves-of-jeroboam","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Made of gold — 1Ki 12:28.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,28,12,28]]},{"text":"Made to prevent the Israelites going to Jerusalem — 1Ki 12:26,27.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,26,12,26],["1Kgs",12,27,12,27]]},{"text":"Golden calves. — 2Ki 10:29; 2Ch 13:8.","refs":[["2Kgs",10,29,10,29],["2Chr",13,8,13,8]]},{"text":"Calves of Bethaven. — Ho 10:5.","refs":[["Hos",10,5,10,5]]},{"text":"Calves of Samaria. — Ho 8:5.","refs":[["Hos",8,5,8,5]]},{"text":"Placed in Dan and Bethel — 1Ki 12:29.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,29,12,29]]},{"text":"Probably from an Egyptian model — 1Ki 11:40.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,40,11,40]]},{"text":"Designed to represent God — 1Ki 12:28.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,28,12,28]]},{"text":"Priests appointed for — 1Ki 12:31; 2Ch 11:15.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,31,12,31],["2Chr",11,15,11,15]]},{"text":"Sacrifices offered to — 1Ki 12:32; 13:1.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,32,12,32],["1Kgs",13,1,13,1]]},{"text":"Feasts appointed for — 1Ki 12:32,33.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,32,12,32],["1Kgs",12,33,12,33]]},{"text":"Were kissed in adoration — Ho 13:2.","refs":[["Hos",13,2,13,2]]},{"text":"Denounced by a prophet. — 1Ki 13:1-3.","refs":[["1Kgs",13,1,13,3]]},{"text":"Adopted by succeeding kings. — 1Ki 15:34; 16:26; 2Ki 10:29,31; 14:24.","refs":[["1Kgs",15,34,15,34],["1Kgs",16,26,16,26],["2Kgs",10,29,10,29],["2Kgs",10,31,10,31],["2Kgs",14,24,14,24]]},{"text":"Became the sin of Israel. — 1Ki 12:30; 2Ki 10:31; 2Ch 13:8.","refs":[["1Kgs",12,30,12,30],["2Kgs",10,31,10,31],["2Chr",13,8,13,8]]},{"text":"God’s people refused to worship — 1Ki 19:18; 2Ch 11:16.","refs":[["1Kgs",19,18,19,18],["2Chr",11,16,11,16]]},{"text":"Guilt of making — 1Ki 14:9,10.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,9,14,9],["1Kgs",14,10,14,10]]},{"text":"Guilt of worshipping — 1Ki 14:15,16; 2Ki 17:22,23.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,15,14,15],["1Kgs",14,16,14,16],["2Kgs",17,22,17,22],["2Kgs",17,23,17,23]]},{"text":"Captivity. — Ho 10:6.","refs":[["Hos",10,6,10,6]]},{"text":"Destruction. — Ho 8:6; 10:8.","refs":[["Hos",8,6,8,6],["Hos",10,8,10,8]]},{"text":"Punishment of the worshippers. — Ho 8:13,14.","refs":[["Hos",8,13,8,13],["Hos",8,14,8,14]]}],"refCount":39}
